// ── the enum index (PERF-3): the ids of kind enum below hc slot 130 (the type count at the last build), by head symbol, ascending, by a counting sort
// in two flat arrays: xi holds the ids, list h is xi[xo(h), xo(h+1)) for h <= hc slot 131 (the largest enum head). Types interned after the build
// (the closure passes) are found by the scan of [build count, count). A head with h + 2 >= kn is not indexed: its scan is the full one.
def Emit.xg(n: I64, xs: Array[U32](n), i: I64): I64 = if 0 <= i && i < n then I64.of(xs(i)) else 0

